Automate API testing for a public REST API using Python

API Under Test
Use the public API:
Base URL: https://reqres.in/api

Tasks
Task 1: GET User List
Endpoint: GET /users?page=2
Validate:
Status code is 200
Response time is less than 2 seconds
Page number is 2
The response contains at least one user
Each user has id, email, first_name, last_name



Task 2: CREATE User
Endpoint: POST /users

Request body:
{
  "name": "Hithendra",
  "job": "SDET"
}

Validate:
Status code is 201
Response contains name, job, and id
Name and job match the request

Task 3: UPDATE User
Endpoint: PUT /users/2

Request body:
{
  "name": "Hithendra",
  "job": "SDET 2"
}

Validate:
Status code is 200
Job title is updated
Response contains updatedAt

Task 4: DELETE User
Endpoint: DELETE /users/2

Validate:
Status code is 204
